{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a Hostile Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded alone after a failed experimental hyperspace jump, you must navigate a dangerous, alien-filled universe. Every encounter is a fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Assemble Your Ship and Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of ship parts and weapon components to create your loadout. Experiment with different combinations to find the setup that fits your playstyle and strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect and Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge energy across hazardous environments to reactivate your drive and attempt the jump back home. Resource management and smart planning are crucial.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless alien foes in tense, twin-stick shooter combat. No two runs are ever the same, and every battle tests your reflexes, strategy, and adaptability.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019210?t=1764144477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019210?t=1764144477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019210/c5f50148b654a0fb2b4dc6795830c60a562c69ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764144477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019210/c5f50148b654a0fb2b4dc6795830c60a562c69ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764144477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_ta